Game.Overview:
The Magical Sound Car is a little car that can run, jump... and plays music while is moving! The kids made courses for the toy and challenge you to beat all them. Simple reach the kids to beat the level and go to the next! This game features:

- Simple controls that anybody can enjoy;
- 60 stages to beat;
- Cute pixel art all in black & white;
- Variety in traps, gimmicks and elements;
- Original chiptune music composed by myself!

Welcome to the Magistrate, a place shrouded in mystery, jealously guarding its secrets, the Secret Office of the glorious country of Miltenstein. Cipher deciphers are highly respected here. Everyone dreams of keeping their secrets and revealing the secrets of others. Information rules this world, doesn't it? Start learning and master the art of cryptography. Any action you take affects the course of events.

Every secret has its price. And people jealously protect them. Remember that some secrets are best left unsolved.

The people from Abacus say that the Magistrate is involved in a conspiracy. The magistrate embraces the Abacus in this. Who is right, how to find out?

â€¨Something bad is happening in the country. The Magistrate, the Order of Accusers, the mysterious Abacus, and even the royal court are plotting their own intrigues. 

Your neighbors are eager to learn the Albiome formula! And they don't even shy away from declaring war on it.

â€¨There's been an attack! It is necessary to solve as many ciphers as possible to protect the homeland from the enemy!

Don't forget what you've been taught.:
* Each puzzle can be solved. Uncover all the secrets that have fallen into your hands.;
* The one who owns the information owns the world: investigate numerous intrigues and conspiracies;
* Knowing too much is quite dangerous: use existing knowledge and make decisions with caution;
* Remember, any action you take affects the course of events;
 One person can make a lot of difference: put an end to the conspiracy against the royal court, expose the traitors and stop the enemy who dared to attack Miltenstein.

A mysterious world of ciphers and secrets awaits you. Discover all its secrets!

Explore a world full of mysteries that transform with each jump! Moonleap is a game about a moon boy on his journey to recover shooting stars. Change day to night with your jump and catch all the stars in this short and challenging puzzle-platformer! An innovative mechanic with simple and accessible controls, walk and jump!

