This is a special edition release of Need for Speed II which provides improved visuals in comparison to the original release. The graphical improvements within this version of the game are only officially supported on 3Dfx Voodoo graphics cards, however, and thus the game is effectively graphically indistinguishable from the original version when played using different hardware.

Besides the graphical improvements, the new additions to this version are:


*    4 new cars: Ferrari F355F1, Ford Mustang Mach III, Italdesign Nazca C2 and Ford Indigo (this last one was only unlockable in the original Need For Speed II);

*    3 new bonus cars to unlock in Tournament mode;

*    1 new track: Last Resort;

*    1 new racing style: Wild;

*    Reverse and mirrored tracks.

OpenTS is a community-led, open-source reconstruction of Command & Conquer: Tiberian Sun. It forgoes patching and extensions to rebuild the original engine standalone from scratch. The project gives equal weight to maintaining a playable engine and providing a capable platform for modding and engine development.

OpenTS is:

* An independent, community-led source reconstruction targeting the behavior of Tiberian Sun 2.03 Firestorm;
* A playable engine built from Electronic Arts' GPL-released source for related Command & Conquer games and Tiberian Sun-specific reverse engineering;
* The active foundation for continued maintenance, documentation, technical modernization, bug fixes, and new modding capabilities.

Pac-Man and the Ghostly Adventures is a 3D platform game based on the cartoon TV series of same name. Pac, Cylindria and Spiral are called to the lab of Sir C. He shows them three golden globes he found and explains that they need to be recharged with Globe energy orbs. And asks if you can help him with collecting the energy orbs. At this point four ghosts appear to warn them that Betrayus, lord of the ghosts, and his army have invaded the city of Pacoplis. Betrayus seems to have stolen some kind of freeze machine from the science center. Itâ€™s up to you to stop him and his army and collecting the energy orbs needed to power the globes of Sir C along the way.

Pac-Man can enter several modes to help him defeat enemies and overcome obstacles. The modes are:

    Chameleon Pac: this gives you the ability to swing from pole to pole with your tongue and makes you invisible;
    Fire Pac: shoot fireballs at your enemies;
    Granite ball Pac: roll over your enemies;
    Ice Pack: freeze your enemies;
    Metal Pac: you gain the ability to attach your body to magnetic platforms;
    Spin Pac: turns you into a spinning top.

The game offers a multiplayer mode of up to four players.

SYNOPSIS

After the failure of the latest entertainment establishment; Percy's Playhouse, you're called by your boss. He informs you that later this week, Percy's is set to be completely demolished for good. So what's the catch here?

Most of the place is cleaned out, and ready for its name to be history. Fortunately, you're tasked with watching over the place for that week - making sure no one breaks in, steals any valuable equipment, and that everything is accounted for before the demolishment on Friday.

Everything needs to be in order. Especially Percy Poodle & Co.

ABOUT

Playtime with Percy is a #fnaf inspired horror game with the primary gameplay structure being revolved around the Pal Percy; a Tamagotchi-like toy. With the core gameplay loop being â€œTasked Based / End at Your Own Paceâ€ instead of the classic â€œSurvive from 12 AM to 6 AMâ€ formula.

Featuring:

A unique core mechanic

5 unique Post-Night Tasks

Hand-drawn Graphics / Animations

A fully original soundtrack

Cutscenes

Bonuses & Extras

